			description: ["Right-click any block of an assembled ship with the Big Bottle,", "standing up. Do NOT sneak -- sneaking just places the block.", "", "It costs 30 experience levels, saves the whole ship to a template and", "hands you the ship in the bottle. Place the bottle to redeploy it."]
